{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1432080-basic-npc-stats-for-opposed-rolls","id":1432080,"title":"Basic NPC stats for opposed rolls","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-13T06:58:12-08:00","id":1432080,"title":"Basic NPC stats for opposed rolls","content":"NPCs in the Continuum supplements have stat blocks for types of actions, such as Police Work 8 indicating total dice pool. However, players often have powers or effects that require rolling against a specific stat and the majority of the time it is a stat for an NPC that isn't detailed because of the build mentioned above. <br /> <br /> This seems like a system oversight and I was wondering how others handled this. When I ran a modern Talent game I would just mentally guess at an appropriate stat level and now as a player in an Aeon game it often comes up when I'm using Psionic powers on NPCs and their stats are never listed.<br /> <br /> Thoughts and opinions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26269-bastion-avalos","name":"Bastion Avalos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-13T07:14:59-08:00","id":1432081,"title":"","content":"There is a side bar that just tell what to do (half of the relevant dice pool is skill and other half is attribute).<br /> <br /> It\u2019s not really oversight, it\u2019s just simplified, if you really need to state a full character it gets complicated to have more than a few characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-13T07:21:00-08:00","id":1432082,"title":"","content":"I halve the pool, usually, assuming half the pool comes from the ability and half comes from the attribute. It makes things easier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-14T04:26:05-08:00","id":1432182,"title":"","content":"I use the same system of halving the dicepool since I started playing V:tR.<br /> I rounf down or up, if it\u00b4s a baseline it\u00b4s rounding down, if not, it\u00b4s rounding up.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}